# Secrets — NEVER commit
**/tokens.json
**/proxy_tokens.json
**/appsettings.json
**/config_notifications.py
**/ai_config.json
shared/sentiment_bridge.json
shared/notifications.json
shared/webgui_auth.json
shared/anthropic_key.txt
shared/alphavantage_key.txt
shared/massive_key.txt
# Belt and braces: the same names ANYWHERE, not only under shared/. A stray copy
# of a key at the repo root was found untracked and unignored on 2026-08-22 —
# one `git add .` from being committed. Only `shared/` is ever READ (see
# `earnings_calendar._KEY_FILE`); a copy elsewhere is always a mistake, and it
# should not also be a publishable one.
**/anthropic_key.txt
**/alphavantage_key.txt
**/massive_key.txt
shared/driver_model.txt
# Which environment this checkout is (dev|prod). Gitignored ON PURPOSE: a git
# pull must never be able to carry an environment identity between checkouts.
# Absent = prod. See docs/plans/2026-08-08-dev-prod-environments-design.md.
config/env.local.toml

# Per-checkout secrets, read by the systemd units' EnvironmentFile=.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY + MEMURAI_PASSWORD. Never committed -- same rule as
# appsettings.json and env.local.toml above.
.env

# The PUBLIC live process's own minimal environment: REDIS_LIVE_URL (a Redis
# ACL password inside a URL) + MEMURAI_PASSWORD. A separate file so the one
# internet-facing process does not hold the fleet's strongest credentials --
# see deploy/systemd/generate_units.py:_live_env_file.
# ⚠ `.env` above does NOT cover this name; gitignore matches it literally.
.env.live


# Databases & runtime state
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
**/sentiment_*.json
!**/sentiment_*.example.json

# Logs
**/logs/
*.log

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# Node
node_modules/

# OS
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Git worktrees
.worktrees/

# Claude Code machine-local settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# portfolio-analyzer runtime trade store
portfolio-analyzer/data/

# claude-driver runtime state (paper trade log + pending-trade payload)
claude-driver/data/

# trade-analyzer fitted swing-model artifact + research report
trade-analyzer/data/

# Stale manual stderr/stdout redirect captures from ad-hoc restarts
*.log.err

# Local artifacts that must never be committed: desktop shortcuts, ad-hoc DB
# backups, the sentiment intraday store, and the generated EOD report archives.
*.lnk
*.db.bak
sentiment-dashboard/data/
webgui/data/eod/
# Runtime GUI preferences, written by the app itself (app_settings.set). Tracked
# until 2026-08-09, which made every prod promote refuse on a dirty tree the
# moment anyone changed a setting in the GUI — tools\promote.bat guards on
# `git status --porcelain` by design. app_settings._load_from_disk falls back to
# DEFAULTS when the file is absent, so an untracked file costs nothing.
webgui/data/settings.json
# Generated text-to-speech clip cache for the Desk's spoken alerts. Regenerated
# on demand by webgui/voice.py; nothing here is worth versioning.
webgui/data/voice/
schwab-proxy/data/
shared/data/
services/trade_svc/data/
# Thumbnail captures for the public live grid. Generated on the box that serves
# them, every 15 min inside [windows.live_capture]. ⚠ NOT committed: tracked,
# they would dirty prod's tree the moment the timer first fires, and
# tools/promote.sh refuses a dirty tree.
deploy/site/live/*.webp
